<BaseLayout title="Company | Blutech IoT Limited" description="Blutech is a Hong Kong building IoT and AIoT company founded in 2019, developing connected sensing, software, edge automation and system integration for real buildings." canonicalPath="/company">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span><span>Company</span></div><div class="kicker">Blutech IoT Limited</div><h1>Building technology that survives contact with the real site.</h1><p>Founded in Hong Kong in 2019, Blutech develops connected-building hardware and software and delivers the engineering work needed to make those systems operate in existing facilities.</p></div></section>
  <section><div class="shell split"><div><div class="kicker">What we are</div><h2>Building IoT & AIoT, end to end.</h2><p class="hero-copy" style="font-size:19px">Blutech works across sensors, wireless networks, local control, cloud or on-premises software, APIs, commissioning and long-term operation. AI is used selectively where it strengthens sensing or automation rather than as a label for every product.</p></div><div class="grid grid-2"><div class="card"><h3>Hardware</h3><p>Privacy-preserving occupancy, environmental, leakage, status, edge I/O, gateways and display products.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Software</h3><p>Blutech Halo for building operations and Blutech Core for IoT infrastructure and integration.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Integration</h3><p>REST, MQTT, BMS and project-specific interfaces that connect new IoT data with existing systems.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Delivery</h3><p>Survey, wireless testing, configuration, installation coordination, T&C, handover and support.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section style="background:var(--bg-2)" id="brands"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">Brand architecture</div><h2>Blutech and BLUTA Fire.</h2><p>Customers should be able to see the relationship without confusing the responsibilities of the two brands.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-2"><div class="card"><div class="meta">Parent technology company</div><h3 style="font-size:34px">Blutech</h3><p>Building IoT & AIoT products, Halo, Core, smart-building solutions, project integration and deployment.</p><a class="card-link" href="/products">Explore Blutech products →</a></div><div class="card brand-callout"><div class="meta" style="color:#ffaaaa">Dedicated fire & life-safety brand</div><h3 style="font-size:34px">BLUTA Fire</h3><p>BLUTA Fire is developed by the Blutech team as the dedicated home for fire-related connected devices, systems and services. Fire-product certification and approval statements are kept with the exact BLUTA product scope.</p><a class="card-link" style="color:#ffb7b7" href="https://bluta.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit bluta.io ↗</a></div></div></div></section>
  <section><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">Recognition</div><h2>Selected awards and recognition.</h2><p>Award wording is kept at the solution/company level unless the official record names a specific product model.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-4"><div class="card"><div class="meta">2020</div><h3>Hong Kong ICT Awards</h3><p>Award of the Year and ICT Startup Grand Award recognition for the Smart Washroom AIoT Solution.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="meta">2021</div><h3>APICTA</h3><p>Start Up of the Year recognition for the Blutech smart washroom solution.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="meta">2024</div><h3>iF DESIGN AWARD</h3><p>Winner — “BLUTECH.IO Smart Washroom AIoT Solution”, Product / Building Technology.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="meta">2023/24</div><h3>Smart Living Partnership Awards</h3><p>Outstanding B2B IoT Solutions recognition.</p></div></div></div></section>
